      "current_tex": "\\begin{proposition}[Minimum Implies Infimum]\n\\label{prop:minimum-implies-infimum}\nLet $A\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}$ and let $n\\in\\mathbb{R}$. If $n=\\min A$, then\n\\[\n  n=\\inf A.\n\\]\n\n\\hyperref[prf:minimum-implies-infimum]{Go to proof.}\n\\end{proposition}",
